                    <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>$L_0$</strong>: The original length of the object before temperature change.</li>
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>$\Delta T$</strong>: The change in temperature ($T_{final} - T_{initial}$).</li>
